{"id":"636651","name":"糯米卷","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/636651/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"中筋面粉","amount":"400克"},{"name":"温水","amount":"200克"},{"name":"糖","amount":"10克"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"4克"}],"sub":[{"name":"糯米","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香肠","amount":"一根"},{"name":"红辣椒","amount":"少许"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"主料中所有的食材放入面包机中，启动发酵功能，搅拌面团。","img":"images/636651/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"搅好的面团发酵。","img":"images/636651/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"趁着发酵面团的时间，准备好糯米，清洗干净，加适量的水，放入电饭煲中。","img":"images/636651/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"按煮饭键，煮成糯米饭。","img":"images/636651/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"香肠、辣椒(不喜欢的可以不放)、葱都切成末。","img":"images/636651/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"起锅烧热，加油。","img":"images/636651/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"油七成热时，下入香肠末煸香。","img":"images/636651/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"翻炒均匀。","img":"images/636651/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"下入糯米粉，翻炒均匀。","img":"images/636651/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入盐、生抽、老抽调味，翻炒均匀。","img":"images/636651/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入辣椒和葱。","img":"images/636651/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"翻炒均匀。","img":"images/636651/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"盛出晾凉，整理成长条形，待用。","img":"images/636651/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"面团也发酵好了(一个小时左右)。","img":"images/636651/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"取出面团，按压排气，团圆。","img":"images/636651/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"擀成长方形面片。","img":"images/636651/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放上糯米。","img":"images/636651/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"卷起。","img":"images/636651/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"切成小剂子，糯米卷生胚就好了。","img":"images/636651/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"依次摆入蒸锅中，中间留出空隙，室温再次松弛20分钟，时间结束后凉水上锅，大火烧开，出气后转中小火蒸15分钟，关火后，再虚蒸3分钟左右。","img":"images/636651/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/636651/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/636651/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/636651/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"成品图。